 "markdown": "**Ashtakavarga chart** (South Indian style, printed page 223)\n\n```\n+-------------+-------------+-------------+-------------+\n| 0000        | 0000        | 000         | 0000        |\n|             |             | 000         |             |\n+-------------+-------------+-------------+-------------+\n| 0000        |                           | 0000        |\n+-------------+                           +-------------+\n| 0000        |                           | L           |\n|             |                           | 00000       |\n+-------------+-------------+-------------+-------------+\n| 00000       | 00000       | 0000        | 00000       |\n+-------------+-------------+-------------+-------------+\n```\n\nLagna is in Leo, so houses are counted from there.\n\n| House | Sign | Bindus |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 (Lagna) | Leo | 5 |\n| 2 | Virgo | 5 |\n| 3 | Libra | 4 |\n| 4 | Scorpio | 5 |\n| 5 | Sagittarius | 5 |\n| 6 | Capricorn | 4 |\n| 7 | Aquarius | 4 |\n| 8 | Pisces | 4 |\n| 9 | Aries | 4 |\n| 10 | Taurus | 6 |\n| 11 | Gemini | 4 |\n| 12 | Cancer | 4 |\n\nTotal bindus: **54** — the standard total for Mercury.\n\n**Ashtakavarga chart** (South Indian style, printed page 223)\n\n```\n+-------------+-------------+-------------+-------------+\n| 000         | 00000       | 00000       | 0000        |\n+-------------+-------------+-------------+-------------+\n| 000         |                           | 0000        |\n+-------------+                           +-------------+\n| 00000       |                           | L 00        |\n|             |                           | 00000       |\n+-------------+-------------+-------------+-------------+\n| 000         | 00000       | 00          | 0000        |\n| 000         |             |             | 000         |\n+-------------+-------------+-------------+-------------+\n```\n\n| Sign | Bindus |\n|---|---|\n| Aries | 5 |\n| Taurus | 5 |\n| Gemini | 4 |\n| Cancer | 4 |\n| Leo | 7 |\n| Virgo | 7 |\n| Libra | 2 |\n| Scorpio | 5 |\n| Sagittarius | 6 |\n| Capricorn | 5 |\n| Aquarius | 3 |\n| Pisces | 3 |\n\nTotal bindus: **56** — the standard total for Jupiter."
